<p> BORROWER   BGB FINANCE IRELAND</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BANKGESSELLSCHAFT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     16.125    MATURITY  **21.APR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.925   PAY DATE    21.APR.97</p>
